<title>JAPAN: Tokyo Theatres - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tokyo Theatres - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  4.15		vs	    4.55</p>
<p> Operating	  417    million	  vs	  516    million</p>
<p> Current	    485    million	  vs	  584    million</p>
<p> Net		  242    million	  vs	  296    million</p>
<p> EPS		    3.03 yen	  vs	    3.70 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     80 million	  vs	  80 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Tokyo Theatres Co Inc operates cinemas and also has video and real estate interests.</p>
